      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Thromboelastography revealed anticoagulant effects of 3 glyproline oligopeptides (in various concentrations): His-Phe-Arg-Trp-Pro-Gly-Pro, Thr-Lys-Pro-Arg-Pro-Gly-Pro (Selank), and Pro-Gly-Pro. The parameters R, K, MA, S, TMA, and J changed to hypocoagulation direction in comparison to the control. At this, Selank demonstrated the maximal anticoagulation potency."},
